# Tab cycles directories in the add prompt. rv <path> opens that work
# tree and writes it into the projects file.
twin
tabdir
wait Unstaged
wait rv  @base  a
send Space
send p
wait Enter switch
send a
wait Enter add
send-path tab
wait aaat
send Tab
wait aaatabother
gone aaatabtarget
send Tab
wait aaatabtarget
gone aaatabother
send Tab
wait aaatabother
gone aaatabtarget
send Escape
wait Enter switch
send Escape
wait a/A approve
send q
gone Unstaged
args @other
restart norepo
wait othertoken
wait rv  @otherbase  a
projects @other
projects-gone @dest
